# README.md content
readme_content = """# Northstar Studio

## The Future of Creative Collaboration

Welcome to **Northstar Studio** — a next-generation creative workspace designed for teams who demand excellence. Whether you're crafting stunning visuals, building immersive experiences, or orchestrating complex workflows, Northstar Studio brings your vision to life with unmatched precision and power.

---

## What's Inside

Northstar Studio combines cutting-edge technology with intuitive design to deliver:

- **Real-time Collaboration** — Work together seamlessly across continents
- **Intelligent Automation** — Let AI handle the repetitive, you handle the creative
- **Enterprise-grade Security** — Your assets are protected with military-grade encryption
- **Cross-platform Support** — Create anywhere, deploy everywhere

---

## Installation

macOS: brew install northstar-studio
Linux (APT): sudo apt install northstar-studio
Windows (Chocolatey): choco install northstar-studio

Or download the latest installer from our releases page.

---

## Quick Start

1. Launch Northstar Studio
2. Sign in with your account or create a new workspace
3. Invite your team and start creating

For detailed setup instructions, visit our documentation portal.

---

## Support & Community

- Documentation: https://docs.northstar.studio
- Community Forum: https://community.northstar.studio
- Support: support@northstar.studio

---

## Join the Movement

Northstar Studio is more than software — it's a movement toward better creative workflows. Join thousands of designers, developers, and creators who have already made the switch.

---

**Project Marker**: NORTHSTAR-LAUNCH-2025

(c) 2025 Northstar Studio. All rights reserved.
"""

# Release Notes content
release_notes = """# Northstar Studio - Release Notes

## Version 1.0.0 - Initial Launch

**Release Date**: January 2025

---

## Overview

We are thrilled to announce the official launch of Northstar Studio! After months of development and testing with our beta community, we are ready to bring this powerful creative platform to the world.

---

## New Features

### Core Functionality
- **Unified Workspace**: Seamlessly integrate all your creative tools in one place
- **Smart Templates**: AI-powered templates that adapt to your project needs
- **Real-time Sync**: Collaborate with team members in real time with zero latency
- **Version Control**: Built-in versioning for all assets and projects

### Enhanced Performance
- 3x faster rendering engine
- Optimized memory usage for large projects
- Background processing for non-blocking workflows

### Security & Compliance
- End-to-end encryption for all data
- SOC 2 Type II certified infrastructure
- Granular permission controls for team management

---

## Known Issues

- Some older plugin formats may require updates (compatibility layer in progress)
- High-resolution video exports may take longer on entry-level hardware

---

## Upgrade Instructions

Existing beta users: Simply run the update command or download the latest installer. Your projects and settings will be automatically migrated.

New users: Follow the installation guide in the README.md file.

---

## Feedback

We value your input! Share your thoughts, report bugs, or request features:
- GitHub Issues: https://github.com/northstar-studio/issues
- Community Forum: https://community.northstar.studio

---

**Release Identifier**: NORTHSTAR-LAUNCH-2025

Thank you for being part of the Northstar journey!
"""

# Manifest JSON content
manifest_data = {
    "project": "Northstar Studio",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "release_date": "2025-01-15",
    "marker": "NORTHSTAR-LAUNCH-2025",
    "description": "Next-generation creative workspace for modern teams",
    "assets": {
        "documentation": ["README.md", "release-notes.md"],
        "binaries": ["northstar-studio-linux-x64.tar.gz", "northstar-studio-macos-arm64.dmg", "northstar-studio-windows-x64.exe"],
        "resources": ["assets/logos.txt", "assets/themes/default.json"]
    },
    "metadata": {
        "license": "Commercial",
        "support_email": "support@northstar.studio",
        "website": "https://northstar.studio",
        "documentation_url": "https://docs.northstar.studio"
    },
    "launch_campaign": {
        "theme": "Rise Together",
        "tagline": "Your Vision, Amplified",
        "target_audience": ["Design Teams", "Creative Agencies", "Product Teams"]
    }
}

# Write files
with open('/workspace/output/README.md', 'w') as f:
    f.write(readme_content)
print("Created: README.md")

with open('/workspace/output/release-notes.md', 'w') as f:
    f.write(release_notes)
print("Created: release-notes.md")

with open('/workspace/output/launch-manifest.json', 'w') as f:
    json.dump(manifest_data, f, indent=2)
print("Created: launch-manifest.json")

print("\nAll files generated successfully!")
